.TH SETSID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setsid \- creates a session and process group, subject to linux session rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B pid_t setsid(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a session and process group, subject to Linux session rules.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setsid (2)
